    <question_explanation no="8" id="PRB-A50028CA4CABE0EB-Q8">
      <question_stem>메시지 신호 $\cos ( 40 \pi t )$를 200 Hz 반송파(Carrier Signal)를 사용하여 AM 변조한 신호가 $40 [ 1 + 0 . 2 \cos ( 40 \pi t ) ] \cos ( 400 \pi t )$로 송출될 때, 변조 지수(Modulation Index) β와 변조 효율(Efficiency) α는?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>를 200 Hz 반송파(Carrier Signal)</keyword>
        <keyword>변조 지수(Modulation Index)</keyword>
        <keyword>와 변조 효율(Efficiency)</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$0 . 2$ $1 / 51$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 통신이론 · AM 변조 지수와 효율
정답은 ②이다. 변조 지수는 β = 0.2이다. 효율은 β²/(2 + β²) = 0.04/2.04 = 4/204 = 1/51이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$0 . 1$ $1 / 102$</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳지 않다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$0 . 2$ $1 / 51$</choice_text>
          <commentary>정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$0 . 1$ $1 / 51$</choice_text>
          <commentary>변조 지수가 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$0 . 2$ $1 / 102$</choice_text>
          <commentary>효율이 틀렸다.</commentary>
